(x) Smt. P. Venkatalakshmamma & others vs. The Special Land Acquisition Officer and others - ILR 2002 KAR 2354;
(xi) Winky Dilawari vs. Amritsar Improvement Trust - (1996) 11 SC 644;
(xii) Union of India and others vs. Ashok Kumar and others - 2006 AIR SC 124;
(xiii) Land Acquisition Collector vs. Durga Pada Mukherjee and other s- 1980 AIR SC 1678;
